n/proposals` — legacy endpoint, 404 since Run 35\\n- `/api/apps/*/skills/operat...[truncated, 21717 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"4b9b742d-dad9-4668-8c21-2eef7ae3d402"}

