ation error log |\\n| **Tool/Token Cost** | `T4` | Tool-call count or token to...[truncated, 44378 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"4b9b742d-dad9-4668-8c21-2eef7ae3d402"}

