ll lack `_meta.json`.\\n\\n| # | Directory | SKILL.md Content Type | Mutation Memento |\\n|---|---|---|--...[truncated, 31778 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"4b9b742d-dad9-4668-8c21-2eef7ae3d402"}

