data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"cwd\":\"/Users/quantum/.macaca/workspaces/a9435a4b-d123-5a4c-b0b7-d9b1342089ea\",\"exit_code\":0,\"stderr\":\"\",\"stdout\":\"=== Sample meta-skill SKILL.md ===\\n---\\nname: evaluation-telemetry-optimization\\ndescription: \\\"Use when a future task needs the governed reusable procedure for evaluation-telemetry-optimization; rely on linked evidence refs, registry visibility, telemetry, curation, approval, and rollback before reuse.\\\"\\n---\\n\\n# evaluation-telemetry-optimization\\n\\n## When To Use\\nUse this skill when a future task matches this bounded procedure: Use linked event-log and Agent Execution trace refs to repeat tasks involving evaluation, telemetry, optimization. Keep the generated Skill concise, trigger-oriented, proposal-linked, registry-visible, telemetry-audited, and governed by app\\n\\n## Procedure\\nUse linked event-log and Agent Execution trace refs to repeat tasks involving evaluation, telemetry, optimization. Keep the generated Skill concise, trigger-oriented, proposal-linked, registry-visible, telemetry-audited, and governed by approval, rollback, and sanitized evidence gates.\\n\\n## Verification\\n- Confirm terminal task evidence is still present before relying on this skill.\\n- Record new evidence refs when the procedure changes.\\n\\n## Provenance\\n- Proposal ref: `skill-exp-39e8b501-5d94-42e2-918f-cb7afedce4a2-1779725351426279000`\\n- Task ref: `39e8b501-5d94-42e2-918f-cb7afedce4a2`\\n- Trace ref: `skill-self-evolution:a9435a4b-d123-5a4c-b0b7-d9b1342089ea:f6a004e8-cbf3-46f6-8ccf-53c0676218e6:coordinator:39e8b501-5d94-42e2-918f-cb7afedce4a2`\\n\\n=== Sample snapshot SKILL.md ===\\n---\\nname: skill-exp-0bd3b7f3-6797-40d8-ba1a-d53409bb4536-1779616302740038000\\ndescription: \\\"Verified terminal task completion observed through service.agent_execution; output_chars=1023, artifact_count=1, token_total=unavailable.\\\"\\n---\\n\\n# skill-exp-0bd3b7f3-6797-40d8-ba1a-d53409bb4536-1779616302740038000\\n\\n## When To Use\\nUse this skill when a future task matches the reusable procedure...[truncated, 2777 bytes]","tool_name":"shell","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"4b9b742d-dad9-4668-8c21-2eef7ae3d402"}

