data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"tool_input":{"content":"# Daily Self-Evolution Monitor — Day 02\n## Task Family: `archive_readiness_probe`\n**Date:** 2026-05-26 (probe executed 2026-05-26T09:40 UTC)\n**Governing Artifact:** `self_evolution_skill_optimization_merge_archive_rules.md` (§4 — Domain C)\n**Predecessor Evidence Chain:** \n- `day-01_archive_readiness_probe.md` — baseline: 3 C1 candidates, 5 blockers, DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY verdict\n- `day-02_precipitation_seed.md` — refreshed counters C1–C25, 32 skills (+6), Δ analysis\n- `day-02_reuse_followup.md` — per-skill inventory, 28/32 template meta-skills, mirroring anomalies\n- `day-02_optimization_probe.md` — telemetry vacuum confirmed, all 32 skills score 0/6 on T1–T6\n- `day-02_duplicate_merge_probe.md` — duplicate detection findings\n**Source Refs:** R1–R9 (canonical), C1–C25 (refreshed)\n\n---\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n1. [Scope & Method](#1-scope--method)\n2. [Landscape Census — All 32 Skills](#2-landscape-census--all-32-skills)\n3. [Real Stale-Threshold Evidence](#3-real-stale-threshold-evidence)\n4. [Forced Diagnostic Stale-Threshold Evidence](#4-forced-diagnostic-stale-threshold-evidence)\n5. [Protection Blockers — Hard Block Conditions](#5-protection-blockers--hard-block-conditions)\n6. [Rollback Requirements Inventory](#6-rollback-requirements-inventory)\n7. [Readiness Verdict: Production vs Diagnostic-Only](#7-readiness-verdict-production-vs-diagnostic-only)\n8. [Prerequisite Infrastructure Gap Analysis — Day-02 Update](#8-prerequisite-infrastructure-gap-analysis--day-02-update)\n9. [Artifact Metadata](#9-artifact-metadata)\n\n---\n\n## 1. Scope & Method\n\nThis probe evaluates archive readiness per **Domain C — Inactive Skill Archival** (§4 of the governing rules artifact). It examines all 32 skill directories currently present in `available_skills/`, cross-referencing:\n\n- **Trigger conditions** C1–C5 (§4.1)\n- **Hard block conditions** (§4.2 — reverse dependency, sole capability class, allowlist reference)\n- **Prerequisite infrastructure** (usage telemetry, registry, `_meta.json` status field)\n\n**Critical distinction applied throughout:** This probe separates **real stale-threshold evidence** (objective timestamps proving inactivity) from **forced diagnostic stale-threshold evidence** (apparent staleness caused by absent measurement infrastructure, not true inactivity).\n\n### 1.1 — Δ from Day-01\n\n| Dimension | Day-01 | Day-02 | Δ | Classification |\n|-----------|--------|--------|---|---------------|\n| Skills evaluated | 27 | **32** | **+6** | 📈 Pipeline production (6 new template meta-skills) |\n| Convention-compliant dirs | 4 | **4** | 0 | ✅ Frozen |\n| `_usage.json` files | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Frozen (still zero) |\n| `.registry.json` files | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Frozen (still zero) |\n| Skills with `status` field | 0 | **0** | 0 | ✅ Frozen (still zero) |\n| C1 candidates (>90 days) | 3 | **3** | 0 | ✅ Stable (weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp) |\n| Approaching threshold (30–89d) | 8 | **8** | 0 | ✅ Stable (gitnexus ×7 + crypto_market) |\n| Day-old candidates (day-01 vintage) | — | 9 | **+9** | ⚠️ Pipeline: now 9 pipeline-produced skills at ~1 day old |\n| Same-cycle candidates (day-02 vintage) | — | 6 | **+6** | ⚠️ Pipeline: 6 meta-skills at <1 day old |\n| Protection blockers | 5 | **5** | 0 | ✅ Still fully blocked |\n| Infrastructure gaps | 7 | **7** | 0 | ✅ None closed |\n| **Readiness classification** | 🔴 DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY | **🔴 DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY** | 0 | **Unchanged** |\n\n### 1.2 — Canonical Data Sources Used (Unchanged)\n\n| Ref | Source | Type | Content Used |\n|-----|--------|------|-------------|\n| R4 | `available_skills/*/` | Directory enumeration | 32 skill dirs, file listings, modification timestamps |\n| R5 | `skills/*/` | Source-root mirror | 11 packages, cross-reference |\n| R8 | `~/.macaca/skills/*/_meta.json` | Global metadata | 4 global entries (unchanged) |\n| R2 | `agent-replay-*.jsonl` | Execution telemetry | 3 files, 10 events, zero `skill_invoke` |\n| R1 | `mission-state.json` | Mission lifecycle | 3 missions, 5 agents, last activity 2026-04-13 |\n| — | `_meta.json` per skill | Governance metadata | 4 files found (of 32) |\n| — | Filesystem `stat` timestamps | Last-modified evidence | All 32 dirs scanned |\n\n### 1.3 — Threshold Defaults (from §6 Glossary)\n\n| Symbol | Domain | Default | Applied In |\n|--------|--------|---------|------------|\n| `T_inactive_days` | C | 90 days | C1 trigger |\n| `T_grace_cycles` | C | 10 cycles | C2 trigger |\n| `T_error_only_min` | C | 3 errors, 0 successes | C3 trigger |\n| `T_archive_retention_days` | C | 365 days | Cleanup policy D1 |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Landscape Census — All 32 Skills\n\n### 2.1 — Convention Compliance Matrix (Expanded from 27 to 32)\n\n| # | Directory | SKILL.md | `_meta.json` | `_usage.json` | `status` Field | Filesystem Age | PublishedAt Age |\n|---|-----------|----------|-------------|-------------|-------------|----------------|-----------------|\n| **Pre-installed (convention-compliant)** | | | | | | |\n| 1 | weather | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | **MISSING** | <1 day* | **141.0 days** |\n| 2 | stock_analysis | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | **MISSING** | <1 day* | **112.1 days** |\n| 3 | playwright_mcp | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | **MISSING** | <1 day* | **106.0 days** |\n| 4 | crypto_market | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | **MISSING** | <1 day* | 69.0 days |\n| **Pre-installed (no `_meta.json`)** | | | | | | | |\n| 5 | gitnexus_cli | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈68 days† |\n| 6 | gitnexus_debugging | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈68 days† |\n| 7 | gitnexus_exploring | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈68 days† |\n| 8 | gitnexus_guide | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈68 days† |\n| 9 | gitnexus_impact_analysis | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈68 days† |\n| 10 | gitnexus_pr_review | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈68 days† |\n| 11 | gitnexus_refactoring | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈68 days† |\n| 12 | chronicle | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈13 days† |\n| 13 | figma | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈13 days† |\n| 14 | figma_mcp | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈13 days† |\n| 15 | golang | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈13 days† |\n| 16 | openspec | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈13 days† |\n| 17 | shadcn_ui | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈13 days† |\n| **Pipeline-produced (day-01 vintage)** | | | | | | | |\n| 18 | telemetry_optimization | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈1 day† |\n| 19 | materialization_activation_telemetry_registry | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈1 day† |\n| 20 | materialization_proposal_linked_skill_package_registry_load_path | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈1 day† |\n| 21 | materialization_skill_package_registry_load_path_usage_telemetry | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈1 day† |\n| 22 | skill-exp-052e6a93-... | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | May 24 | ≈2 days |\n| 23 | skill-exp-2b07b1df-... | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | May 24 | ≈2 days |\n| 24 | skill-exp-4d613241-... | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | May 24 | ≈2 days |\n| 25 | skill_exp_0bd3b7f3_... | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈1 day |\n| 26 | skill_exp_1590b4d7_... | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | ≈1 day |\n| **NEW Pipeline-produced (day-02 vintage)** | | | | | | | |\n| 27 | evaluation_telemetry_optimization | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | **<1 day** |\n| 28 | linked_event_execution_trace_refs_repeat_involving_evaluation | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | **<1 day** |\n| 29 | materialization_governance_telemetry_optimization | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | **<1 day** |\n| 30 | materialization_registry_load_path_activation_telemetry | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | **<1 day** |\n| 31 | materialization_telemetry_validation_optimization | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | **<1 day** |\n| 32 | telemetry_registry | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | <1 day* | **<1 day** |\n\n> * Filesystem `stat` shows `May 26 09:39` for most directories (batch touch from pipeline operations). PublishedAt or filesystem-first-seen timestamps are authoritative for age.\n> † Approximate ages based on day-01 baseline (exact publishedAt not available for skills without `_meta.json`). Day-01 had gitnexus at 67.1d, chronicle/figma etc. at 12.5d. Day-02 adds ~9 hours.\n\n### 2.2 — Aggregate Counters — Day-02\n\n| Metric | Day-01 | Day-02 | Δ | Reference |\n|--------|--------|--------|---|-----------|\n| Total skill directories | 27 | **32** | +6 | C4 (Day 02) |\n| Convention-compliant (SKILL.md + `_meta.json`) | 4 | **4** | 0 | C5 (Day 02) |\n| Compliance ratio | 4/27 (14.8%) | **4/32 (12.5%)** | **−2.3pp** | Eroding |\n| With `_usage.json` (telemetry) | 0 | **0** | 0 | C15 (Day 02) |\n| With `.registry.json` | 0 | **0** | 0 | C14 (Day 02) |\n| With `status` field populated | 0 | **0** | 0 | All MISSING |\n| Source-root mirror packages (`skills/`) | 5 | **11** | +6 | C23 (Day 02) |\n| Mutation mementos | 18 | **29** | +12 | C24 (Day 02) |\n\n### 2.3 — Age Stratification (Day-02)\n\n```\n>90 days (C1 triggered)     ═══ [3] weather (141d), stock_analysis (113d), playwright_mcp (107d)\n60–89 days (approaching)    ═══ [8] crypto_market (69d), gitnexus ×7 (~68d)\n13–15 days (chronicle batch)═══ [6] chronicle, figma, figma_mcp, golang, openspec, shadcn_ui\n1–2 days (day-01 pipeline)  ═══ [9] telemetry_optimization, materialization ×4, skill-exp ×4\n<1 day (day-02 pipeline)    ═══ [6] evaluation_telemetry_optimization, → telemetry_registry\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. Real Stale-Threshold Evidence\n\n**Definition:** Objective, measurable timestamps proving a skill has not been invoked or modified for a period exceeding `T_inactive_days` (90 days default). These are independent of telemetry infrastructure.\n\n### 3.1 — Skills Exceeding `T_inactive_days` (90 days) — Confirmed from Day-01\n\nThe same 3 skills identified on day-01 remain the only skills exceeding the 90-day threshold. Ages have advanced by approximately +9 hours — not enough to add any new candidates.\n\n| # | Skill | Day-01 Age | Day-02 Age | Δ | Threshold Exceeded? | Evidence |\n|---|-------|-----------|-----------|---|-------------------|----------|\n| **C1-Candidate 1** | **weather** | 141.0 days | **141.0 days** | +9h | **⚠️ YES** | PublishedAt `2026-01-05` (1767545394459 ms); zero `_usage.json`; zero replay events; no filesystem modification before pipeline batch touch |\n| **C1-Candidate 2** | **stock_analysis** | 112.1 days | **112.1 days** | +9h | **⚠️ YES** | PublishedAt `2026-02-02` (1770041353575 ms); same evidence pattern |\n| **C1-Candidate 3** | **playwright_mcp** | 106.0 days | **106.0 days** | +9h | **⚠️ YES** | PublishedAt `2026-02-08` (1770565004575 ms); same evidence pattern |\n\n**Supporting telemetry evidence (unchanged from day-01):**\n- No `skill_invoke` events exist in any of the 3 agent-replay files (10 events total, all `agent_start`/`agent_stop`)\n- Last agent activity across all missions: `2026-04-13` (43 days of absolute agent inactivity — +1 day since day-01)\n- No `_usage.json` exists for any skill — telemetry infrastructure is entirely absent\n- No `.registry.json` exists — no registration, no allowlist, no reverse-dependency graph\n- Replay logs are **frozen**: same 3 files, same 10 events, same 5 duration captures as day-01\n\n### 3.2 — Skills Approaching Threshold (30–89 days) — Updated Ages\n\n| # | Skill | Day-01 Age | Day-02 Age | Days to 90d Threshold | Notes |\n|---|-------|-----------|-----------|----------------------|-------|\n| C1-Approaching 1 | crypto_market | 68.6 days | **69.0 days** | **21 days** | PublishedAt 2026-03-18; has `_meta.json` but no status |\n| C1-Approaching 2 | gitnexus_cli | 67.1 days | **~68 days** | **~22 days** | No `_meta.json`; filesystem-origin estimate |\n| C1-Approaching 3 | gitnexus_debugging | 67.1 days | **~68 days** | **~22 days** | Same batch |\n| C1-Approaching 4 | gitnexus_exploring | 67.1 days | **~68 days** | **~22 days** | Same batch |\n| C1-Approaching 5 | gitnexus_guide | 67.1 days | **~68 days** | **~22 days** | Same batch |\n| C1-Approaching 6 | gitnexus_impact_analysis | 67.1 days | **~68 days** | **~22 days** | Same batch |\n| C1-Approaching 7 | gitnexus_pr_review | 67.1 days | **~68 days** | **~22 days** | Same batch |\n| C1-Approaching 8 | gitnexus_refactoring | 67.1 days | **~68 days** | **~22 days** | Same batch |\n\n**Projected C1 trigger dates (at current pace):** The gitnexus batch and crypto_market will cross the 90-day threshold around **2026-06-16 to 2026-06-18** — approximately 21–23 days from day-02.\n\n### 3.3 — Trigger Conditions Met (Per §4.1) — Day-02 Update\n\n| Trigger | Day-01 Skills Triggered | Day-02 Skills Triggered | Δ | Analysis |\n|---------|-----------------------|-----------------------|---|----------|\n| **C1** — No invocations within 90-day lookback | weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp (3) | **weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp (3)** | **0** | No new C1 candidates. Ages advanced by only +9h. |\n| **C2** — Zero invocation count after grace cycles | All 27 (forced) | **All 32 (forced)** | **+5** | 5 new skills added to the false-positive pool. Still unactionable — no `_usage.json` exists. |\n| **C3** — Error-only usage history | Cannot assess | **Cannot assess** | 0 | Zero telemetry means zero error data. Unchanged. |\n| **C4** — Deprecated without replacement | Cannot assess | **Cannot assess** | 0 | No skill has `status: deprecated`. Unchanged. |\n| **C5** — Manual archive flag | None flagged | **None flagged** | 0 | No `archiveCandidate = true` found. Unchanged. |\n\n**C2 observation day-02:** All 32 skills now technically meet C2 (zero invocation count after grace cycles). The 6 new day-02 meta-skills extend the false-positive pool. This remains a **forced diagnostic false positive** — the condition fires because `_usage.json` has never been deployed, not because the skills are proven inactive.\n\n### 3.4 — PublishedAt Chronology — Day-02\n\n```\n2026-01-05  weather                          ⚠️ 141 days (C1 triggered)\n2026-02-02  stock_analysis                   ⚠️ 112 days (C1 triggered)\n2026-02-08  playwright_mcp                   ⚠️ 107 days (C1 triggered)\n2026-03-18  crypto_market                    69 days (approaching)\n2026-03-19  gitnexus_* (x7)                  ~68 days (filesystem evidence; no meta)\n2026-05-13  chronicle/figma/                 13 days (recent metadata pass)\n            golang/openspec/\n            shadcn_ui\n2026-05-24  skill-exp-* (x5 UUID)            2 days (day-01 experimental)\n2026-05-25  materialization-* (x4)           ~1 day (day-01 meta-skills)\n            telemetry_optimization\n            skill_exp_* (x2 UUID)\n2026-05-25T16:27  evaluation_telemetry_optimization        <1 day (NEW day-02 meta-skills)\n                  linked_event_execution_trace_refs_...     <1 day\n                  materialization_governance_telemetry_...  <1 day\n                  materialization_registry_load_path_...    <1 day\n                  materialization_telemetry_validation_...  <1 day\n                  telemetry_registry                        <1 day\n```\n\n### 3.5 — Age Progression Watch: Day-01 → Day-02\n\nThe following skills are progressing toward the 90-day threshold. The table shows their day-over-day age increase and projected C1 trigger date.\n\n| Skill | Day-01 Age | Day-02 Age | Daily Δ | Projected C1 Trigger | Days Remaining |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|---------|---------------------|---------------|\n| crypto_market | 68.6d | 69.0d | +0.4d | 2026-06-17 | ~22 |\n| gitnexus_cli | 67.1d | ~68d | +0.9d | ~2026-06-16 | ~21 |\n| gitnexus_debugging | 67.1d | ~68d | +0.9d | ~2026-06-16 | ~21 |\n| gitnexus_exploring | 67.1d | ~68d | +0.9d | ~2026-06-16 | ~21 |\n| gitnexus_guide | 67.1d | ~68d | +0.9d | ~2026-06-16 | ~21 |\n| gitnexus_impact_analysis | 67.1d | ~68d | +0.9d | ~2026-06-16 | ~21 |\n| gitnexus_pr_review | 67.1d | ~68d | +0.9d | ~2026-06-16 | ~21 |\n| gitnexus_refactoring | 67.1d | ~68d | +0.9d | ~2026-06-16 | ~21 |\n\n**NEW: The approaching candidates will accumulate at ~1 day per calendar day.** By day-07 (~2026-05-31), the crypto_market and gitnexus skills will be at ~73–74 days. At current rate, the first wave of new C1 triggers will occur around **day-22 to day-24** (~2026-06-16 to 2026-06-18).\n\n---\n\n## 4. Forced Diagnostic Stale-Threshold Evidence\n\n**Definition:** Conditions that superficially appear to indicate staleness but are in reality consequences of absent measurement instrumentation. These are false positives for archive candidacy.\n\n### 4.1 — Infrastructure Gaps Producing False Positives — Day-02 Update\n\n| Gap | Impact | Skills Affected (Day-01) | Skills Affected (Day-02) | Δ | Status |\n|-----|--------|------------------------|-------------------------|---|--------|\n| **G1** — Zero `_usage.json` files | No invocation count, no last-invoked timestamp | All 27 (100%) | **All 32 (100%)** | +5 | ❌ Unresolved |\n| **G2** — Zero `.registry.json` files | No allowlist, no reverse-dependency graph | All 27 (100%) | **All 32 (100%)** | +5 | ❌ Unresolved |\n| **G3** — Zero `status` field | Cannot distinguish lifecycle phase | All 27 (100%) | **All 32 (100%)** | +5 | ❌ Unresolved |\n| **G4** — Zero `stateTransitions[]` | No lifecycle provenance | All 27 (100%) | **All 32 (100%)** | +5 | ❌ Unresolved |\n| **G5** — No `_meta.json` (21→28 skills) | No ownerId, version, publishedAt | 21 (78%) | **28 (87.5%)** | +7 | ❌ Worsened |\n| **G6** — No `skill_invoke` events | Skill invocation never recorded | All 27 (100%) | **All 32 (100%)** | +5 | ❌ Unresolved |\n| **G7** — Agent replay frozen (42→43 days) | No recent execution cycles | All agents | **All agents** | +1 day | ❌ Worsened |\n\n**Day-02 key finding: Gap G5 has worsened** — 28 of 32 skills (87.5%) now lack `_meta.json` entirely, up from 21 of 27 (77.8%) on day-01. The 6 new day-02 meta-skills were all created without `_meta.json`, continuing the pattern of convention-noncompliant pipeline production.\n\n### 4.2 — Forced C2 Trigger (False Positive) — Expanded Pool\n\n**Day-01 diagnosis:** All 27 skills technically met C2. **Day-02 update:** All **32** skills now technically meet C2 (zero invocation count after grace cycles). The 6 new day-02 skills, being <1 day old, have not yet accumulated 10 grace cycles, but since zero cycles have elapsed with telemetry, they still meet the condition definition.\n\n**Diagnosis unchanged:** C2 is unactionable until `_usage.json` infrastructure is established. The false-positive pool has grown from 27 to 32.\n\n### 4.3 — Forced C3/C4/C5 Triggers (Not Assessable) — Unchanged\n\n| Trigger | Day-01 | Day-02 | Δ |\n|---------|--------|--------|---|\n| C3 — Error-only usage | Cannot assess | **Cannot assess** | 0 |\n| C4 — Deprecated without replacement | Cannot assess | **Cannot assess** | 0 |\n| C5 — Manual archive flag | None flagged | **None flagged** | 0 |\n\n### 4.4 — Consequences of Diagnostic-Only Status — Expanded Impact\n\n| If archive were attempted today... | Day-01 Result | Day-02 Result | Δ |\n|-----------------------------------|--------------|--------------|---|\n| `_meta.json` status update to `archived` | ❌ Impossible for 21/27 (no meta) | **❌ Impossible for 28/32 (no meta)** | **Worsened** |\n| `archivedAt` timestamp recording | ❌ Impossible without meta | **❌ Impossible without meta** | Unchanged |\n| Registry removal | ❌ No registry exists | **❌ No registry exists** | Unchanged |\n| Archive index append | ❌ No index exists | **❌ No index exists** | Unchanged |\n| Reverse-dependency check | ❌ Cannot perform | **❌ Cannot perform** | Unchanged |\n| Sole-capability-class check | ❌ Cannot perform | **❌ Cannot perform** | Unchanged |\n| Allowlist reference check | ❌ Cannot perform | **❌ Cannot perform** | Unchanged |\n\n### 4.5 — Diagnostic Evidence Summary: Day-01 vs Day-02\n\n| Dimension | Day-01 Signal | Day-02 Signal | Interpretation |\n|-----------|--------------|--------------|----------------|\n| C1 real triggers | 3 (valid) | **3 (valid)** | ✅ Confirmed — same candidates, stable evidence |\n| C2 forced false positives | 27 | **32** | 📈 Growing — new skills amplify the false signal |\n| Skills lacking meta (G5) | 21 (78%) | **28 (87.5%)** | 📉 Worse — ratio declined |\n| Telemetry infrastructure | 0% deployed | **0% deployed** | ✅ Frozen at zero |\n| Agent inactivity period | 42 days | **43 days** | 📈 +1 day — extending |\n| Days since day-01 probe | — | **~9 hours** | ⏱ Minimal elapsed time |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Protection Blockers — Hard Block Conditions\n\nPer §4.2, archive SHALL NOT proceed if any hard block condition is true. Day-02 re-evaluation confirms all blockers persist from day-01.\n\n### 5.1 — Hard Block Evaluation — Day-02 Update\n\n| Block Condition | Day-01 Result | Day-02 Result | Δ |\n|----------------|--------------|--------------|---|\n| **B1 — Active reverse dependency** | ❌ Cannot evaluate — zero `dependencies` fields exist | **❌ Cannot evaluate — still zero `dependencies` fields** | 0 |\n| **B2 — Sole capability class rep** | ⚠️ Partially evaluable — 4 skills with meta; gitnexus overlap | **⚠️ Same — still only 4 with meta. NEW: 28 template meta-skills share identical capability class (keyword substitution only), reducing sole-rep risk for any single one but creating a new \"uniform capability class\" pattern.** | ⚠️ Changed pattern |\n| **B3 — Active allowlist reference** | ❌ Cannot evaluate — zero `.registry.json` files | **❌ Cannot evaluate — still zero `.registry.json` files** | 0 |\n\n**NEW Day-02 insight for B2:** The 28 template meta-skills all share the same capability class (keyword-based skill description without executable content). This means:\n- No single meta-skill is the sole representative of its capability class — there are 27 others with identical structure\n- However, this also means **archiving any individual meta-skill would have no capability-loss impact** since 27 identical-capability siblings exist\n- This reduces the protection rationale for meta-skills but does not make them archive-ready (other blockers still apply)\n\n### 5.2 — Protection Blocker Summary — Day-02 Update\n\n| Blocker | Severity | Affected Candidates (Day-01) | Affected Candidates (Day-02) | Δ | Workaround Needed |\n|---------|----------|----------------------------|----------------------------|---|-------------------|\n| No `_meta.json` for 28/32 skills | **CRITICAL** | All non-convention skills (21) | **All non-convention skills (28)** | **+7** | Create `_meta.json` with slug, ownerId, version, publishedAt, status |\n| No `status` field in any `_meta.json` | **CRITICAL** | weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp, crypto_market (4) | **Same 4** | 0 | Add `status: \"active\"` or `\"draft\"` |\n| No `_usage.json` for any skill | **HIGH** | All 27 | **All 32** | **+5** | Deploy telemetry collection; wait ≥1 execution cycle |\n| No `.registry.json` | **HIGH** | All 27 | **All 32** | **+5** | Create registry with skill entries |\n| No `dependencies[]` in any meta | **MEDIUM** | All 27 | **All 32** | **+5** | Populate dependency graph |\n| Zero `stateTransitions[]` logs | **MEDIUM** | All 27 | **All 32** | **+5** | Initialize state transition history |\n| No archive index file | **LOW** | N/A | **N/A** | 0 | Create `shared/skill-archive-index.json` |\n\n### 5.3 — Blocking Score by Candidate — Day-02 Update\n\n| Candidate | Meta Present | Status Present | Telemetry | Registry | Dependency Data | **Archive-Block Score** |\n|-----------|-------------|---------------|-----------|----------|----------------|------------------------|\n| weather | ✅ | ❌ (MISSING) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **5/5 blockers** |\n| stock_analysis | ✅ | ❌ (MISSING) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **5/5 blockers** |\n| playwright_mcp | ✅ | ❌ (MISSING) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **5/5 blockers** |\n| crypto_market | ✅ | ❌ (MISSING) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **5/5 blockers** |\n| gitnexus_* (x7) | ❌ | ❌ (no meta) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **6/5 blockers** (no meta is extra) |\n| chronicle/figma/... (x6) | ❌ | ❌ (no meta) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **6/5 blockers** |\n| Pipeline day-01 (x9) | ❌ (mostly) | ❌ (no meta) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **6/5 blockers** |\n| Pipeline day-02 (x6) | ❌ | ❌ (no meta) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **6/5 blockers** |\n\n> Score interpretation: 0 = archive-ready, 5+ = fully blocked. **All 32 candidates score maximum blockers. No skill has cleared a single blocker since day-01.**\n\n### 5.4 — Blocker Progression Tracker\n\n| Blocker Clearance Metric | Day-01 | Day-02 | Δ | Target |\n|-------------------------|--------|--------|---|--------|\n| Skills with `_meta.json` | 4 | **4** | 0 | 32 |\n| Skills with `status` field | 0 | **0** | 0 | 32 |\n| Skills with `_usage.json` | 0 | **0** | 0 | 32 |\n| Skills with `.registry.json` | 0 | **0** | 0 | 32 |\n| Skills with `stateTransitions[]` | 0 | **0** | 0 | 32 |\n| Archive index file exists | ❌ | **❌** | 0 | ✅ |\n\n**Blocker clearance progress: 0% → 0%. No blocker has been partially or fully cleared between day-01 and day-02.**\n\n---\n\n## 6. Rollback Requirements Inventory\n\nPer §5.3 of the governing rules, every archive action requires a rollback record with 14 mandatory fields. The day-02 assessment is unchanged from day-01: zero rollback infrastructure exists.\n\n### 6.1 — Pre-Archive Snapshot Requirements — Day-02 Update\n\n| Rollback Requirement | Day-01 Available? | Day-02 Available? | Δ |\n|---------------------|------------------|------------------|---|\n| Pre-archive SKILL.md snapshot | ❌ | **❌** | 0 |\n| Pre-archive `_meta.json` snapshot | ❌ (21/27 no meta) | **❌ (28/32 no meta)** | **Worsened** |\n| Original action review ID | ❌ | **❌** | 0 |\n| Reviewer attribution | ❌ | **❌** | 0 |\n| Pre-rollback state description | ❌ | **❌** | 0 |\n| Rollback ID namespace | ❌ | **❌** | 0 |\n| Data restoration path | ❌ | **❌** | 0 |\n\n### 6.2 — Rollback Record Template Readiness — Unchanged\n\n- **Rollback data preservation rule** (§5.3): *\"Before executing any optimization, merge, or archive, the pre-action state of SKILL.md and `_meta.json` SHALL be preserved as a snapshot within the corresponding audit record.\"*\n- **Current status:** Zero pre-action snapshots exist for any skill. The 6 new day-02 skills have no `_meta.json` to snapshot and no pre-action state to preserve.\n- **Required:** A snapshot capture mechanism that copies SKILL.md + `_meta.json` to the audit record before any state change.\n\n### 6.3 — Rollback Path Per Candidate (Hypothetical) — Day-02 Update\n\n| Candidate | If Archived, Rollback Would Require | Day-02 Complexity Change |\n|-----------|--------------------------------------|-------------------------|\n| weather | Create `_meta.json` status field first; restore SKILL.md from hypothetical snapshot | Unchanged |\n| stock_analysis | Same as weather; subdirs (docs, scripts) must be verified | Unchanged |\n| playwright_mcp | Same pattern | Unchanged |\n| gitnexus_* (x7) | Create entire `_meta.json` ex nihilo | Unchanged |\n| Pipeline (day-01, x9) | Create entire `_meta.json`; content is template, not executable | **NEW — content is meta-skill template, not a real procedure** |\n| Pipeline (day-02, x6) | Create entire `_meta.json`; content is template, not executable | **NEW — same pattern as day-01 pipeline** |\n\n**Day-02 addition:** The 15 pipeline-produced skills (9 day-01 + 6 day-02) present a unique rollback challenge: their SKILL.md content is template text with keyword substitution, not an executable procedure. If archived, rollback would restore non-functional template content — the skill would still be unusable. This means **archiving pipeline meta-skills carries lower rollback risk** (no executable content to lose) but also **lower value** (archiving non-functional skills is cosmetic, not substantive).\n\n**Rollback readiness verdict:** 🔴 **NOT READY** (unchanged from day-01). No rollback infrastructure exists for any of the 32 skills.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Readiness Verdict: Production vs Diagnostic-Only\n\n### 7.1 — Summary Judgment — Day-02\n\n| Dimension | Day-01 Status | Day-02 Status | Δ | Detail |\n|-----------|-------------|-------------|---|--------|\n| Candidate identification | ✅ **Done** | **✅ Done (confirmed)** | 0 | 3 C1 candidates (weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp) — same as day-01 |\n| Real stale evidence | ✅ **Collected** | **✅ Collected (refreshed)** | 0 | PublishedAt timestamps confirmed; ages advanced by +9h |\n| Forced diagnostic evidence | ✅ **Separated** | **✅ Separated (expanded)** | 0 | C2 false-positive pool grew from 27→32; G5 worsened |\n| Protection blocker evaluation | ⚠️ **Partial** | **⚠️ Partial (unchanged)** | 0 | All blockers still in place; no progress on any |\n| Rollback infrastructure | ❌ **Absent** | **❌ Absent (unchanged)** | 0 | No snapshots, no backup, no rollback IDs |\n| Archive index | ❌ **Not created** | **❌ Not created** | 0 | `shared/skill-archive-index.json` does not exist |\n| Registry | ❌ **Absent** | **❌ Absent** | 0 | No `.registry.json` for any skill domain |\n| Telemetry (`_usage.json`) | ❌ **Zero deployed** | **❌ Zero deployed** | 0 | All 32 skills lack usage tracking |\n| `_meta.json` status field | ❌ **Missing on all 27** | **❌ Missing on all 32** | **+5** | No skill has a populated `status` field |\n| Compliance ratio | 4/27 (14.8%) | **4/32 (12.5%)** | **−2.3pp** | Declining |\n\n### 7.2 — Readiness Classification — Unchanged\n\n```text\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              ARCHIVE READINESS VERDICT               │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                      │\n│   🔴  DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY  —  NOT PRODUCTION-READY      │\n│                                                      │\n│   VERDICT UNCHANGED FROM DAY-01.                     │\n│                                                      │\n│   Changes since day-01:                              │\n│     • 6 new template meta-skills added               │\n│     • Compliance ratio declined: 14.8% → 12.5%       │\n│     • G5 (missing _meta.json) worsened: 78% → 87.5%  │\n│     • Agent inactivity: 42 → 43 days                 │\n│     • Zero infrastructure gaps closed                │\n│     • Zero blocker clearance progress                 │\n│                                                      │\n│   Minimum additional cycles to production            │\n│   (unchanged from day-01): 3 cycles                  │\n│   (GAP-1 → GAP-2 → GAP-4 + GAP-3 → archive exec)    │\n│                                                      │\n│   However, infrastructure deployment shows           │\n│   zero acceleration: no gaps closed between          │\n│   day-01 and day-02.                                 │\n│                                                      │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 7.3 — Candidate Watchlist — Day-02 Update\n\nThe same 3 confirmed C1 triggers remain the top priority candidates. **No new C1 candidates have emerged** since day-01 because only ~9 hours have elapsed.\n\n| Priority | Skill | Slug | Days Since Published | Day-01 Rank | Δ | Risk | \n|----------|-------|------|---------------------|------------|---|------|\n| **P1** | weather | `weather` | 141.0 | P1 | 0 | Highest; pre-dates all others by >1 month |\n| **P2** | stock_analysis | `stock-analysis` | 112.1 | P2 | 0 | Second; complex subdirectory structure (docs, scripts) |\n| **P3** | playwright_mcp | `playwright-mcp` | 106.0 | P3 | 0 | Third; has `_meta.json` but no status |\n\n**NEW — Watchlist additions for next cycle:**\n| Watch Priority | Skill | Current Age | Projected C1 Date | Days Remaining |\n|---------------|-------|------------|-------------------|---------------|\n| **W1** | crypto_market | 69.0d | ~2026-06-17 | ~22 days |\n| **W2–W8** | gitnexus_* (×7) | ~68d | ~2026-06-16 | ~21 days |\n\n### 7.4 — Pipeline Skill Archive Considerations (NEW for Day-02)\n\nThe 15 pipeline-produced skills (9 day-01 + 6 day-02) represent a **new category** for archive readiness assessment. They differ fundamentally from pre-installed skills:\n\n| Dimension | Pre-installed (17 skills) | Pipeline-produced (15 skills) |\n|-----------|-------------------------|------------------------------|\n| Content type | Executable procedures (domain-specific) | Template text with keyword substitution |\n| Capability uniqueness | High — each covers a distinct domain | Low — 28/32 share same template structure |\n| Archive risk | High — capability loss if sole rep | Low — 27 siblings with identical capability |\n| Rollback complexity | High — real content to restore | Low — template can be regenerated |\n| Convention compliance | 4/17 (23.5%) have `_meta.json` | 0/15 (0%) have `_meta.json` |\n| Age distribution | 3–141 days | <2 days |\n\n**Implication:** Pipeline meta-skills have lower archive-blocking severity because they carry no unique executable content. However, this does not change the infrastructure readiness verdict — the archive machinery (registry, index, rollback, status field) is still required regardless of content value.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Prerequisite Infrastructure Gap Analysis — Day-02 Update\n\n### 8.1 — Gap Closure Roadmap — Progress Check\n\n| Layer | Action Required | Day-01 Status | Day-02 Status | Δ | Days Without Progress |\n|-------|----------------|--------------|--------------|---|----------------------|\n| **GAP-1** | `_meta.json` creation for 21→28 skills | ❌ | **❌ (28 now deficient)** | **Worsened** | **~47 days since first identified in Run 22** |\n| **GAP-2** | Status field population on all skills | ❌ | **❌** | 0 | Same |\n| **GAP-3** | `_usage.json` deployment | ❌ | **❌** | 0 | Same |\n| **GAP-4** | `.registry.json` creation | ❌ | **❌** | 0 | Same |\n| **GAP-5** | Archive index creation | ❌ | **❌** | 0 | Same |\n| **GAP-6** | Snapshot mechanism | ❌ | **❌** | 0 | Same |\n| **GAP-7** | Rollback namespace | ❌ | **❌** | 0 | Same |\n\n**Day-02 key finding: GAP-1 has widened.** The number of skills requiring `_meta.json` creation has grown from 21 to 28 (+7), while zero have been retrofitted. The gap between governed skills (4) and ungoverned skills (28) is increasing.\n\n### 8.2 — Dependency Graph for Production Readiness — Unchanged\n\n```\nGAP-1 (_meta.json) ──► GAP-2 (status field) ──► GAP-4 (registry)\n                                         │\n                                         └──► GAP-3 (_usage.json) ──► C1/C2/C3 assessment\n                                                                          │\n                                                                          ▼\n                                                              Archive Candidate Confirmation\n                                                                          │\n                                                     GAP-5 (index) ◄─────┘\n                                                          │\n                                                     GAP-6 (snapshot)\n                                                          │\n                                                     GAP-7 (rollback)\n                                                          │\n                                                          ▼\n                                                  PRODUCTION-READY\n```\n\n### 8.3 — Gap Widening Rate Analysis\n\n| Metric | Day-01 | Day-02 | Rate | Trajectory |\n|--------|--------|--------|------|-----------|\n| Total skill count | 27 | 32 | +5/cycle | 📈 Growing |\n| Convention-compliant count | 4 | 4 | 0/cycle | → Static |\n| Compliance ratio | 14.8% | 12.5% | −2.3pp/cycle | 📉 Declining |\n| Skills needing `_meta.json` | 21 | 28 | +7/cycle | 📈 Expanding |\n| Telemetry infrastructure | 0% | 0% | 0% | → Frozen |\n\n**At the current rate, by day-10 (assuming +5 skills/cycle, 0 retrofits):**\n- Total skills: ~72\n- Convention-compliant: 4 (same)\n- Compliance ratio: ~5.6%\n- Skills needing `_meta.json`: ~68\n- GAP-1 magnitude: ~3× day-02 level\n\nThis widening gap means each day of delay increases the total effort required to reach production-ready archive capability.\n\n### 8.4 — Minimum Viable Path to Production — Day-02 Assessment\n\nDay-01 projected: **3 additional cycles** from day-01.\n\nDay-02 reality: **Zero infrastructure progress made.** The minimum viable path is still:\n1. **Cycle N:** Create `_meta.json` for 28 skills (up from 21) + populate `status` on all 32 + create empty archive index.\n2. **Cycle N+1:** Deploy `_usage.json` creation hook + create `.registry.json` + deploy snapshot mechanism.\n3. **Cycle N+2:** Execute 1 observation cycle (let telemetry accumulate).\n4. **Cycle N+3:** Re-run archive readiness probe.\n\n**Minimum: Still 3 cycles from day-02 (but with +7 more `_meta.json` files needed than day-01).**\n\n### 8.5 — What Would Clear the Blockers (Day-02 Edition)\n\nThe following atomic actions would each clear one blocker:\n\n| # | Action | Blocker Cleared | Skills Affected |\n|---|--------|----------------|----------------|\n| `A1` | Add `status: \"draft\"` to weather's `_meta.json` | B1 (partial) | weather (1) |\n| `A2` | Add `status: \"draft\"` to all 4 convention-compliant meta files | B1 (partial) | weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp, crypto_market (4) |\n| `A3` | Create `_meta.json` for 1 pipeline meta-skill (any) | B1 (partial) | 1 of 28 |\n| `A4` | Create `shared/skill-archive-index.json` with empty `archived[]` | B5 | All (infrastructure) |\n| `A5` | Deploy `_usage.json` for 1 skill with `invocationCount: 0` | B3 | 1 of 32 |\n| `A6` | Create `.registry.json` with 1 skill entry | B4 | All (infrastructure) |\n\n**None of these actions have been taken between day-01 and day-02.**\n\n---\n\n## 9. Artifact Metadata\n\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| Artifact | `shared/self_evolution_2026-05-26_day-02_archive_readiness_probe.md` |\n| Task Family | `archive_readiness_probe` |\n| Date | 2026-05-26 (probe executed 2026-05-26T09:40 UTC) |\n| Governing Rules | `self_evolution_skill_optimization_merge_archive_rules.md` §4 (Domain C) |\n| Predecessor Probes | `day-01_archive_readiness_probe.md`, `day-02_precipitation_seed.md`, `day-02_reuse_followup.md`, `day-02_optimization_probe.md`, `day-02_duplicate_merge_probe.md` |\n| Skills Evaluated | 32 (+5 from day-01) |\n| Real Stale Candidates | 3 (weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp) — unchanged |\n| Approaching Threshold | 8 (crypto_market at 69d, gitnexus ×7 at ~68d) — unchanged candidates, ages advanced by ~9h |\n| Projected New C1 Triggers | ~2026-06-16 to 2026-06-18 (gitnexus batch and crypto_market) |\n| Forced Diagnostic Triggers | C2 (all 32 — false positive), C3 (unassessable), C4 (unassessable) |\n| Protection Blockers Found | 5 (unchanged) — B1/B2/B3 all still blocking |\n| Infrastructure Gaps Identified | 7 (unchanged) — GAP-1 widened (21→28 skills need meta) |\n| Rollback Readiness | 🔴 NOT READY — zero snapshot/backup infrastructure (unchanged) |\n| Blocker Clearance Progress | 0% — no progress on any blocker since day-01 |\n| Compliance Ratio | 12.5% (4/32) — declined from 14.8% (4/27) |\n| **Readiness Classification** | **🔴 DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY — NOT PRODUCTION-READY (Unchanged)** |\n| Minimum Cycles to Production | 3 additional cycles (unchanged, but with increased workload) |\n| Days Since First Archive Gap ID | ~47 days (since Run 22, first identified telemetry gap) |\n| Reviewer | `coordinator` (automated probe, Day 02 cycle) |\n\n---\n\n## Appendices\n\n### Appendix A — Counter Snapshot (Day-02 archive_readiness_probe)\n\n| ID | Counter | Day-01 | Day-02 | Δ |\n|----|---------|--------|--------|---|\n| C1 | Governance artifacts | 56 | **62+** | +6+ |\n| C2 | Governance lines | ~13,000 | **~15,500+** | +2,500+ |\n| C3 | Verification artifacts | 6 | **6** | 0 |\n| C4 | `available_skills/` dirs | 27 | **32** | +6 |\n| C5 | Convention-compliant dirs | 4 | **4** | 0 |\n| C6 | Pipeline dirs with `proposal_id` | 0 | **0** | 0 |\n| C7 | `_meta.json` with `proposal_id` | 0 | **0** | 0 |\n| C8 | Agent replay files | 3 | **3** | 0 |\n| C9 | Replay events | 10 | **10** | 0 |\n| C10 | Duration captures | 5 | **5** | 0 |\n| C11 | Missions | 3 | **3** | 0 |\n| C12 | Agents | 5 | **5** | 0 |\n| C13 | Non-null `completedSummary` | 0 | **0** | 0 |\n| C14 | `.registry.json` files | 0 | **0** | 0 |\n| C15 | `_usage.json` files | 0 | **0** | 0 |\n| C16 | `*.sse` files | 0 | **0** | 0 |\n| C17 | MCP servers (pre-installed) | 1 | **1** | 0 |\n| C18 | MCP servers (proposal-derived) | 0 | **0** | 0 |\n| C19 | Skill catalog entries (ops API) | 4 | **4** | 0 |\n| C20 | Curation/rejection/promotion artifacts | 0 | **0** | 0 |\n| C21 | Session UUIDs (shared) | 137 | **137** | 0 |\n| C22 | Session UUIDs (root) | 92 | **92** | 0 |\n| C23 | Source-root skill packages | 5 | **11** | +6 |\n| C24 | Mutation mementos | 18 | **29** | +12 |\n| C25 | Crontab entries | 0 | **0** | 0 |\n\n### Appendix B — Day-02 Evidentiary Sources\n\n| Source | Path | Evidence Used |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| Skill directories | `available_skills/*/` | Existence, content, convention compliance, timestamps |\n| Metadata files | `available_skills/*/_meta.json` | publishedAt, slug, version, status field |\n| Mission state | `shared/.omc/state/mission-state.json` | Agent activity, completedSummary |\n| Replay logs | `shared/.omc/state/agent-replay-*.jsonl` | skill_invoke events, agent activity |\n| Mutation mementos | `*/.macaca/skill-mutation-mementos/*.json` | Creation provenance, captured_at timestamps |\n| Day-01 probe | `shared/self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_archive_readiness_probe.md` | Baseline ages, blocker evaluation, gap analysis |\n| Day-02 probes | `shared/self_evolution_2026-05-26_day-02_*.md` | Refreshed counters C1–C25, per-skill inventory, telemetry audit |\n\n### Appendix C — Predictions for Day-03\n\n| # | Prediction | Basis | Test |\n|---|-----------|-------|------|\n| **P1** | C1 candidates will remain 3 (weather, stock, playwright) | Only ~24h will have elapsed — insufficient to add new 90d candidates | Check ages at day-03 |\n| **P2** | No infrastructure gaps closed (C14=0, C15=0) | Day-02 showed zero progress; pattern holds across 2 cycles | Check C14, C15 |\n| **P3** | Compliance ratio ≤12.5% (C5 ≤4, C4 ≥32) | Pipeline produces non-compliant skills; no retrofits observed | Check C4, C5 |\n| **P4** | `_meta.json` status field still missing on all skills | Zero `status` additions in 2 cycles; no evidence of change | Check all `_meta.json` for `status` key |\n| **P5** | Archive index still absent | Not created in 2 cycles; no evidence of planned creation | Check for `shared/skill-archive-index.json` |\n| **P6** | Agent inactivity period reaches 44 days | Extends by +1 day per calendar day | Check replay log latest timestamp |\n| **P7** | Crypto_market and gitnexus ages advance ~1 day (70d and ~69d) | Natural time progression | Check publishedAt and filesystem ages |\n\n**Prediction failure threshold:** If ≥3 of P1–P7 are falsified by day-03 evidence, the archive readiness probe's trend model should be revised.\n\n---\n\n*End of Day 02 archive readiness probe. Application-neutral. No business logic, provider names, raw prompts, or secrets captured.*\n\n*Key findings: Archive readiness status is UNCHANGED from day-01 — 🔴 DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY, NOT PRODUCTION-READY. The same 3 C1 candidates (weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp) remain the only skills exceeding the 90-day inactive threshold. 6 new template meta-skills were added (+22% growth) but zero infrastructure gaps were closed. Compliance ratio declined from 14.8% to 12.5%. GAP-1 (missing `_meta.json`) widened from 21 to 28 deficient skills. All 5 protection blockers persist. Zero progress on any of the 7 infrastructure gaps. The gap between skill production and archive capability is widening.*\n\n*Age progression tracking established for 8 approaching skills. First new C1 triggers projected at day-22 to day-24 (~2026-06-16 to 2026-06-18) for the gitnexus batch and crypto_market. Predictions for day-03 registered (P1–P7). All evidence bounded to stable refs R1–R9 and counters C1–C25.*\n","path":"shared/self_evolution_2026-05-26_day-02_archive_readiness_probe.md"},"tool_name":"file_write","type":"tool_call"},"task_id":"4b9b742d-dad9-4668-8c21-2eef7ae3d402"}

